      "source": "// A sample for the recorded Stryker report.\nexport function clamp(value: number, low: number, high: number): number {\n  if (value < low) return low;\n  if (value > high) return high;\n  return value;\n}\n\nexport function label(n: number): string {\n  return n === 1 ? \"one\" : \"many\";\n}\n"
